#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about the authorization roles and permissions available for the IBM Quantum REST APIs."
msgstr "Alamin ang mga authorization role at permissions na available para sa mga IBM Quantum REST API."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles"
msgstr "Mga authorization role"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles {#authorization-roles}"
msgstr "Mga authorization role {#authorization-roles}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review the available roles and the actions mapped to each to help you assign access. See [IAM roles and actions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155) on IBM Cloud&reg; for more information.\n"
msgstr "Suriin ang mga available na role at ang mga aksyong nauugnay sa bawat isa para matulungan kang mag-assign ng access. Tingnan ang [IAM roles and actions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155) sa IBM Cloud&reg; para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

